      "id": "17872",
      "key": "SFCC-36",
      "summary": "AP21 Price Feed Integration — Base RRP & Fixed Pricelists",
      "description": "As a\n Site Admin, \n\n\nI want\n SFCC to receive and process all AP21 pricing data via MuleSoft — including base RRP prices for all storefronts and fixed per-market pricelists for Global-e markets, \n\n\nso that\n current selling prices, original RRP, markdown status, future-dated sale prices, and market-specific fixed prices are accurately loaded into the correct SFCC pricebooks.\nAP21 is the master system for all product pricing at Zimmermann. \nPricing flows AP21 → MuleSoft → SFCC across two feed types built as a single integration contract. \nThe base RRP feed serves all storefronts; the fixed pricelist feed serves Global-e markets configured with the Fixed Pricelist conversion approach \nhttps://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-45\n. These are designed together to avoid two separate MuleSoft pipeline specs for the same source system.",
