      "id": "17883",
      "key": "SFCC-47",
      "summary": "Global-e FX & Pricing Job",
      "description": "As a\n Site Admin, \n\n\nI want\n SFCC to run a nightly job that retrieves FX rates and country price coefficients from Global-e and generates pre-calculated per-market pricebooks, \n\n\nso that \nshoppers on Global-e storefronts see prices in their local currency without real-time FX conversion at browse time.\nThe nightly pricing job runs on a scheduled basis and performs the following steps:\nRetrieve FX rates and coefficients — SFCC calls the Global-e API to retrieve the current FX rates and per-country price coefficients for all configured Global-e markets\nApply conversion formula — for each product/SKU in each Global-e market, SFCC calculates the local price using: base AUD price × FX rate × country coefficient\nApply rounding rules — the calculated price is rounded per the currency rounding rules configured in SFCC (covered in Currency Conversion Approach Configuration story)\nWrite to pricebooks — the calculated prices are written to the relevant per-market pricebooks in SFCC, ready for storefront display\nMarkets configured with a Fixed conversion approach (manually set prices from AP21 fixed pricelists) are excluded from the FX calculation — their pricebook entries are managed via the AP21 price feed, not this job.",
