      "id": "17880",
      "key": "SFCC-44",
      "summary": "Country-Currency Mapping & Maintenance",
      "description": "As a\n Site Admin, \n\n\nI want\n to configure and manage country-to-currency mappings in SFCC Business Manager, \n\n\nso that\n shoppers are automatically shown prices in the correct currency for their country when they land on a storefront.\nDomestic storefronts — SFCC controls which currency pricebook is served:\nAU storefront (ZimmermannAU) → \nAUD\n — \nau-aud-list-prices\n / \nau-aud-sale-prices\nUK storefront (ZimmermannUK) → \nGBP\n — \nuk-gbp-list-prices\n / \nuk-gbp-sale-prices\nUS Domestic storefront (ZimmermannUS) → \nUSD\n — \nus-usd-list-prices\n / \nus-usd-sale-prices\nEU Domestic storefront (ZimmermannEU) → \nEUR\n — \neu-eur-list-prices\n / \neu-eur-sale-prices\n (same price across all EU countries; per-country VAT handled by Avalara)\nGlobal-e storefronts — Global-e determines the display currency per session; SFCC loads the matching pre-populated pricebook:\nUS International (ZimmermannUSIntl) → SFCC base: \nUSD\n; MXN also has a dedicated pricebook (\nusintl-mxn-*\n); additional currencies handled by Global-e FX at runtime\nEU International (ZimmermannEUIntl) → SFCC base: \nEUR\n; 17 additional currencies with dedicated pricebooks: GBP, CHF, ALL, AMD, AZN, BAM, DKK, FKP, GEL, ISK, MDL, MKD, NOK, RSD, SHP, SRD and XCD\nHK (ZimmermannHK) → SFCC base: \nUSD\n; dedicated pricebooks for Global-e display currencies: CNY, SGD, THB and HKD\nNote: HKD is also a Global-e display currency but the SFCC base pricebook is USD, not HKD\nME (ZimmermannME) → SFCC base: \nEUR\n; dedicated pricebooks for Global-e display currencies: AED, BHD, SAR, KWD\nSee \nhttps://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-45\n for the conversion approach configuration that governs how prices are calculated into each pricebook. \nSee \nhttps://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-46\n for currency display formatting rules (symbol, decimal places, separators).",
