      "id": "18552",
      "key": "SFCC-275",
      "summary": "Cart Page – Button Group",
      "description": "As a\n Shopper, I want to see a clear group of checkout actions in my cart, so that I can proceed to checkout using my preferred payment method.\nThis is a \nPWA Kit UI component story\n covering the button group within the cart summary component (SFCC-816). The button group consists of three buttons rendered in a fixed stacked order: Checkout CTA (primary), Apple Pay Express (secondary), and Google Pay Express (secondary).\nCheckout CTA\n — the primary checkout action. All storefronts direct to the same SFCC checkout entry page. For international storefronts, the checkout experience is the same but Global-e renders within an iframe at the appropriate step — the routing and Global-e iframe integration is covered in \nhttps://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-63\nApple Pay Express\n — express checkout via Apple Pay. The Apple Pay integration, browser detection, and show/hide logic based on device/browser eligibility or region are covered in the Payments epic (SFCC-383) — not this story.\nGoogle Pay Express\n — express checkout via Google Pay. The Google Pay integration, browser detection, and show/hide logic based on device/browser eligibility or region are covered in the Payments epic (SFCC-384) — not this story.\nImage for reference (Figma is leading):",
