      "id": "18199",
      "key": "SFCC-117",
      "summary": "Footer — Contentful Component",
      "description": "As a\n Site Merchandiser,\nI want\n the global footer content managed in Contentful,\nso that\n I can configure footer navigation links, their destinations, copy, and legal text per storefront without requiring a developer deployment.\nThis story is a follow-up to \nhttps://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-55\n , which builds the footer shell and layout with placeholder content. This story covers the Contentful content model and integration so that all footer content is fully Contentful-managed. Footer content includes navigation link columns (e.g. About, Contact, Help), legal and copyright text, region-specific links (e.g. Acknowledgement of Country for AU), and the bottom bar. Email sign-up integration (Omneo) is covered separately in \nhttps://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-99\n and \nhttps://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-100\n .\nThe Subscribe Section includes an email input field rendered by the PWA Kit component. The field mechanics — capture, validation, and submission — are managed by the Omneo integration and are out of scope for this story. Contentful is responsible for the surrounding copy only: the section label and marketing headline that appear above the input field.\nThe Locale Picker displayed in the footer Legal bar (e.g. \"United States\") is not managed in Contentful. It is driven by the active storefront context in PWA Kit and is covered in the companion PWA Kit Footer story.\nDesign UI Kit: \nhttps://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann_Design_System_2026?node-id=2083-54022&p=f&t=WFhhGIKbAYN1PWQ1-0\n  \nDesktop\nMobile",
