      "summary": "Promotions – Global-e Cart Handoff with Applied Promotions and Coupon Codes",
      "description": "As a \nShopper on an international storefront, \nI want\n any promotions and coupon codes I have applied to my cart to be honoured when I proceed to Global-e checkout, \nso that\n my discounts are correctly reflected in my final order.\nWhen a shopper on a Global-e storefront proceeds to checkout, SFCC passes the complete cart to Global-e including all applied promotions, coupon codes, and discount values in the customer's target currency. Coupon validation occurs within SFCC before handoff — Global-e does not re-validate. Promotions configured as percentage discounts apply post-conversion; fixed-amount promotions must be in the target currency per PRC-42 (covered in SFCC-198). Global-e does not call back to SFCC for coupon validation.\nThis story is owned by Integration and covers the SFCC-side cart payload construction and handoff to Global-e only. The Global-e checkout experience itself is out of scope.",
