      "id": "19207",
      "key": "SFCC-747",
      "summary": "Logo Masthead – PWA Kit Component",
      "description": "As a\n Shopper, \nI want\n to see the Zimmermann logo in the header on every page, \nso that\n I can identify the brand and return to the homepage from anywhere on the site.\nThis is a \nPWA Kit component story\n. It covers the build of the \nLogo Masthead\n React component in the PWA Kit storefront — the Zimmermann wordmark that renders in the header on every page across all storefronts and devices. The logo masthead was initially included as part of SFCC-52 (Global Header UI), which covered its visual placement only. This story supersedes the logo portion of SFCC-52 and defines the full \nLogo Masthead\n component including link behaviour, responsive sizing, and accessibility. The logo is a static brand asset — it is not managed in Contentful or Business Manager and does not vary by storefront. Scroll behaviour is explicitly out of scope and is covered in SFCC-93 (Logo Scroll Behaviour). Hover/focus visual states are defined in the UI kit and are not repeated here.\nMotion Design: \nhttps://zimmermann-handover-ja2o39l78-song-ddp-anz.vercel.app/#templates%2Fmain\nUI Kit: \nhttps://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann_Design_System_2026?node-id=2083-53927&p=f&t=SM2wFRxPI0PhFS9u-0\n ",
