      "id": "19213",
      "key": "SFCC-750",
      "summary": "Footer - PWA Kit Component",
      "description": "As a\n Shopper, \nI want\n to see a consistent global footer on every page, \nso that\n I can access navigation links, contact information, and newsletter sign-up from anywhere on the site.\nThis is a \nPWA Kit component story\n. It covers the build of the Footer React component in the PWA Kit storefront. The Footer component renders at the bottom of every page on the default page template across all storefronts and devices. It consumes content managed in Contentful — see companion Contentful story \nhttps://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-117\n \nThis story supersedes \nhttps://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-55\n, which was written before the new component approach was developed. The Disclaimer component is separate and covered in \nhttps://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-749\n \nThe following are also explicitly out of scope: email sign-up Omneo integration (SFCC-99/100), Cookie Settings behaviour (separate story), and hover/focus/active visual states (defined in UI kit).\nThe Locale Picker displayed in the Legal bar (e.g. United States) is driven by the active storefront context in PWA Kit and is not managed in Contentful. The Locale Picker will not display on AU storefront, since the customer cannot change storefronts since AU is gated. \nNote: The checkout template uses a simplified footer which is a separate component and covered in a separate story - \nhttps://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-841\n \nUI Design Kit: \nhttps://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann_Design_System_2026?node-id=2083-54022&p=f&t=8DrHJtkYe3Taw9hz-0\n ",
