{"result":"{
  "id": "17883",
  "key": "SFCC-47",
  "summary": "Global-e FX & Pricing Job",
  "description": "**As a** Site Admin, \n**I want** SFCC to run a nightly job that retrieves FX rates and country price coefficients from Global-e and generates pre-calculated per-market pricebooks, \n**so that** shoppers on Global-e storefronts see prices in their local currency without real-time FX conversion at browse time.\n\n----\n\nThe nightly pricing job runs on a scheduled basis and performs the following steps:\n\n- Retrieve FX rates and coefficients — SFCC calls the Global-e API to retrieve the current FX rates and per-country price coefficients for all configured Global-e markets\n- Apply conversion formula — for each product/SKU in each Global-e market, SFCC calculates the local price using: base AUD price × FX rate × country coefficient\n- Apply rounding rules — the calculated price is rounded per the currency rounding rules configured in SFCC (covered in Currency Conversion Approach Configuration story)\n- Write to pricebooks — the calculated prices are written to the relevant per-market pricebooks in SFCC, ready for storefront display\n\nMarkets configured with a Fixed conversion approach (manually set prices from AP21 fixed pricelists) are excluded from the FX calculation — their pricebook entries are managed via the AP21 price feed, not this job.",
  "status": {
    "name": "To Do",
    "category": "To Do",
    "color": "blue-gray"
  },
  "updated": "2026-09-01T14:54:39.230+1000"
}"}

