{"result":"{
  "id": "17968",
  "key": "SFCC-63",
  "summary": "Global-e Checkout Handoff",
  "description": "Placeholder story — covers the outbound handoff from SFCC to Global-e at checkout for international orders. When a shopper on a Global-e storefront (EU International, HK, ME, US International) proceeds to checkout, SFCC passes the cart and customer data to Global-e which owns the checkout experience including delivery address capture, delivery method selection, billing address, duties & tax calculation, and payment. Global-e returns the confirmed order payload to SFCC via webhook",
  "status": {
    "name": "To Do",
    "category": "To Do",
    "color": "blue-gray"
  },
  "updated": "2026-08-10T16:29:31.613+1000"
}"}

